    },
    {
      "id": "heYACgGoQXqFmoAvWNUr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755,
      "y": 8698,
      "width": 632.32,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "sjCdODYE5G08lBKcmD3w"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 987339065,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 668213901,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795082621082,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C'est quoi : T64 donne aussi la dépense de formation rapportée au budget.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C'est quoi : T64 donne aussi la dépense de formation rapportée au budget.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b8M"
    },
    {
      "id": "Mq78uOmZdxILUTI1WsrN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755,
      "y": 8726,
      "width": 800.32,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "sjCdODYE5G08lBKcmD3w"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1685216857,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 148822211,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795082621082,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Objectif : dans T64, le second ratio doit rapporter la formation au bon budget. Il permet de\nvoir quelle part du budget va à la formation (Annuaire CIPRES, p. 52). La réponse permet de\nchoisir les comptes et la version du budget.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Objectif : dans T64, le second ratio doit rapporter la formation au bon budget. Il permet de\nvoir quelle part du budget va à la formation (Annuaire CIPRES, p. 52). La réponse permet de\nchoisir les comptes et la version du budget.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b8N"
    },
    {
      "id": "uWGljBz04mbdm8IEQtR4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755,
      "y": 8794,
      "width": 735.0400000000001,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "sjCdODYE5G08lBKcmD3w"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1474474840,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 464144621,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795082621082,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dans la base : une formation (GRH_FORMATION) garde l'année de son budget, pas son\nmontant. Le budget est dans Oracle GL (vue V_BI_BALANCE_COMPTABLE, montants\nbudgétés).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dans la base : une formation (GRH_FORMATION) garde l'année de son budget, pas son\nmontant. Le budget est dans Oracle GL (vue V_BI_BALANCE_COMPTABLE, montants\nbudgétés).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b8O"
    },
    {
      "id": "UKMIjNIdr5aTGmWDoWdN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1755,
      "y": 8862,
      "width": 576.1600000000001,
